   d) Use the Software for any purpose, including commercial purposes.

2. ECOSYSTEM INTEGRITY REQUIREMENTS
   If you distribute the Software or derivative works:
   
   a) You MUST NOT modify the core protocol constants:
      - The `/sell` endpoint path
      - The `/listing` endpoint path
      - The `reposell` protocol identifier
      - The canonical repository identity format
   
   b) You MUST preserve the PaymentProvider abstraction interface
      and MUST NOT hardcode Stripe or any single payment provider.
   
   c) You MUST preserve the GitProvider abstraction interface
      and MUST NOT hardcode GitHub as the only provider.
   
   d) You MUST preserve the zero-config principle: all values that
      can be derived from Git/GitHub/CI MUST be auto-derived.

