7. VALIDATION REQUIREMENT
   Any distribution claiming to be "reposell CLI" or "compatible with
   reposell" MUST pass the official validation suite:
   
   a) The `reposell doctor` command MUST report no errors;
   
   b) The `acc check` command MUST report no ACC0xx errors;
   
   c) The official protocol test suite MUST pass;
   
   d) The cryptographic identity and signature verification MUST work
      with the official verification key.

   Failure to pass validation means the distribution MAY NOT use the
   "reposell" name or claim protocol compatibility.

